{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_title", "source_sha256": "772f379e6d715e2074c4af0e8795c416fe55b9ff81885924be228b0555fd1ff6", "ja": "星を見つけて", "zh": "找到繁星", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b88b8b7952490515f9522d05079d2ce2ceb692235c0614b0054b83b7040f1216", "ja": "『アイグラ！！』のアンケートをきっかけに\n夢について考えるジュリア。そんな時元いた\nバンドが解散するかもしれないと聞き、\n劇場に立って新曲を披露。今の自分の夢と、\n皆にも夢を諦めてほしくないことを伝える。", "zh": "以《偶图！！》的问卷为契机，\n茱莉亚开始思考起了梦想。此时她听说\n曾经所属的乐队可能会解散，便登上剧场\n的舞台表演了新曲。向大家传达了自己如今的梦想，\n以及希望大家也不要放弃梦想的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1000_050jul", "source_sha256": "f6229559bc8ea5af9fb8481fe1c15e78c83c78559e455ac2430e278f9183aeaf", "ja": "えっと、弦はこれでよし、と……。\nそういえば、クロスももうなかったんだよな。", "zh": "呃，琴弦这样就没问题了……  \n说起来，擦琴布也已经没有了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "86eb0bf7fb7193fd0cb39de15289d796bd9e1985cafa9b424b8c2e886b51f34b", "ja": "（近ごろ、ツアーのレッスンで忙しくて……\nなんてのは、言い訳だよな……）", "zh": "（最近忙着参加巡演的训练……这种话，说到底只是借口吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "502f03c60fd118fc1ee6bbd47bc0500027b2aadce679e8ac3772176ab12f6739", "ja": "（たまに家にいる時くらい、ちゃんと練習しないと。\nギターの腕なんて、あっという間に鈍るからな）", "zh": "（偶尔在家的时候，也得好好练习才行。毕竟吉他的功力一下子就会生疏的）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1003_null", "source_sha256": "c85e7057f5ee3fa5a6eaf3d079cf25eec7b88f388ae365992c676a36ab2ededc", "ja": "あれ……もしかして、ジュリアさん？", "zh": "咦……难道是茱莉亚先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "b2f0adf7ab2800ce31d9cf956bfc9825e4fe49afeda38a144a2ddeb896388a3e", "ja": "えっ……ああっ、ヒロ！？　お前、ヒロじゃないか！\nなんでこんなところにいるんだよ！？", "zh": "咦……啊！是阿博！？你不是阿博吗！\n你怎么会在这种地方啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1005_hiro", "source_sha256": "be7b71508fd2b0ac758be02648a03a952aad46165724d6f856c3a16713db6c9f", "ja": "オレは、バイト行くところで……\nあ、オレら上京してきたんですよ！", "zh": "我正要去打工……\n啊，我们是到东京来闯荡的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "37237978d35dff95f5e053e68d2cdece985da2c0d112c64575f3e17a35eadf2b", "ja": "えっ、そうなのか？　バンドを再結成したってのは、\nネットで見かけたけど……。", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？我在网上看到过你们乐队重组的消息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1007_hiro", "source_sha256": "788e6c02047fa064d0fa22f8caa807f8f4837f01e8802ec8878900b07a46f492", "ja": "はい。その後、東京の事務所にスカウトされて……\nすこし前に、メンバー全員で上京したんです。", "zh": "是的。那之后，我被东京的事务所发掘了……\n前不久，所有成员一起上京了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "0a79a8d6a601e396dfe37688443be70def3749865a8d87a77d30c165bbe47551", "ja": "おお……マジか。やったな！\nお前らなら、絶対いけるって！　がんばれよ！", "zh": "哦……真的吗？太好了！\n你们的话，绝对没问题！加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1009_hiro", "source_sha256": "f4c2ee6de9554b452407697e3e0cad0ab2ad17d8e05103d10bfbb67c437de4fd", "ja": "……それよりジュリアさん、\nまだギター弾いてるんですね。", "zh": "……比起这个，茱莉亚先生，\n你还在弹吉他呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "e34c390abe6b01f8032ecb0460152f7d191083ea651238734f8895182fcf544b", "ja": "当たり前だろ。ギターは、あたしの魂だからな！", "zh": "那当然了。毕竟吉他可是我的灵魂啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1011_hiro", "source_sha256": "369d79d668cce63471028f24658ab405a9b574fd07686c839c3c9d88bb88e6fb", "ja": "でも、アイドルやりながらですよね。\n頑張っててえらいな……。", "zh": "不过，你还要一边做偶像吧。\n一直努力，真了不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1012_hiro", "source_sha256": "da14723ab798185da31cc90c7d9b5a050369f027b46eb505639f23f17b1c5015", "ja": "オレらなんて、事務所は決まったけど……\n色々あって、未だにデビューもできてないし。", "zh": "我们这些人啊，虽然事务所是定下来了……  \n但经历了各种事情，到现在还没能出道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "b183f943ad226eec3f0bf456ef14ff63e7808329672e265a409038f76ad734a3", "ja": "そ、そうなのか……。", "zh": "这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1014_hiro", "source_sha256": "f9959c1f163601838d3c72d168485e18dac943671c8f914467072271055f53dd", "ja": "それに最近じゃ、みんなバイトが忙しくて。\n全員で集まって練習する時間も取れないし……。", "zh": "而且最近大家打工都很忙。\n连全员集合练习的时间都抽不出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1015_hiro", "source_sha256": "a7575d247209ef921b0cb4f79af825e0f3dab67dbd75646bd654ae0506462a19", "ja": "ジュリアさんはソロになったけど、オレらはバンドで。\nお互い、夢を叶えられたらって思ってましたけど……。", "zh": "茱莉亚老师虽然单飞了，但我们则组了乐队。\n我们曾想着，要是能互相实现彼此的梦想就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1016_hiro", "source_sha256": "a4d19e2bf3eaf12a8869447c34c65e652d92674fa5a8a6909e924592d80d7c09", "ja": "オレらのほうは、無理かもしれないな……。", "zh": "我们这边，可能不行吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "420505f1d02ef16dae32f5c34abe8b07db51b2367f93bc4c908fe9756d3d51fe", "ja": "っ……。", "zh": "唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1018_hiro", "source_sha256": "d4afb79e90671d33ac0479c3166c01b7f1733af801d03cf55cbd04d7e97ac24a", "ja": "あっ……すみません！　久しぶりなのに、\n愚痴みたいなコト言っちゃって！", "zh": "啊……对不起！难得这么久没见，\n却跟您说了些像是在发牢骚的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1019_hiro", "source_sha256": "693abc13d9a219432f5c3103e763e03ecacff6ec2d205c19a4e3080d6eec093d", "ja": "あの、もうバイト行く時間なんで！\nそれじゃ、また！", "zh": "那个，我已经到打工的时间了！\n那就，下次见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "cc2394e0b158d849f7232bb7631ef9444aa9120b0363f0f47b84e5898553159b", "ja": "あ、ああ……。", "zh": "啊、啊啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1022_null", "source_sha256": "c578352b19a8a2238f510e79d501ab37e2b07c3e9222a6ddb04d0d030c179758", "ja": "LOVERS HEART　ツアー中……", "zh": "LOVERS HEART　巡演中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1023_p", "source_sha256": "90c95237be07539a055ba877b84b5cf60ca038b86c0fed9eb86ae551187fe8cc", "ja": "（中央エリアでの公演は、順調に進んでいる。\nただ、ジュリアはまだ、何か悩んでいる様子だ……）", "zh": "（LOVERS HEART的巡演中……中央区域的公演进展得很顺利。不过，茱莉亚似乎还在为什么烦恼着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1025_p", "source_sha256": "4d5426c71c5536b2a6244bca769f66dcf1a4619d357e40e4ab0819ab3e97ae01", "ja": "お疲れ、ジュリア。\nアンケートの事、悩んでるのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，茱莉亚。\n你还在为问卷的事烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "d7f301990177274daafe07248fffa7e9492443de2204321e003b9d5e2c5c0439", "ja": "ああ、{$P$}か……お疲れ。\nそうだ、アンケートもあったんだったな……。", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}啊……辛苦了。\n对了，原来还有问卷这回事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1027_p", "source_sha256": "32be8677e9d047a06b7c379231e1aae8da6092d7372c19545d39a9569f89864b", "ja": "てっきり、アンケートの事で悩んでいるのかと\n思ってたよ。何かあったのか？", "zh": "我还以为你是在为问卷的事烦恼呢。发生什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "a615ea4a23d6c0bad1f50b6dad6d50a1e5c164f34487f6eccf2e452249e59b3b", "ja": "この前、劇場にアンケート用紙を取りに行っただろ。\nその帰り、楽器屋で、昔のメンバーに会ってさ……。", "zh": "前些天不是去剧场拿问卷了吗？回来的路上，在乐器店遇到了以前的成员……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d57268b48e0124284c36a31d4dc8cb2778d7b2a423d5720c8a5215846d15711b", "ja": "メンバーって、ジュリアが組んでたバンドのか。\n九州で活動してるんじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "你说的成员，是茱莉亚组过的乐队成员吗？不是说在九州活动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "ed997815b0bc341ffc5a65af5258184d1cca82a19b032b14d106086f7d262002", "ja": "スカウトの話があって、こっちに出てきてたらしい。\nでも、何か色々、状況が変わったみたいで……。", "zh": "听说是因为有人来找她谈出道，所以才来到这边的。\n不过，好像情况什么的发生了不少变化……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "f6e42e6e08922970da33cf46aed99328bb13476bc207dcbcd5d34a721ee1bd7c", "ja": "音楽続けるの、難しいかもしれないって言われたよ。\nあたし、何も言えなくってさ……。", "zh": "有人对我说，继续做音乐可能会很难。我什么都说不出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1032_p", "source_sha256": "e4fdba82449cb7f3ad590af3a993317ab00ce4149ce595111a0d13093d058f93", "ja": "そうか……。", "zh": "是吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "2794868f07b7c33fc5131a222927fcf4cd15a80e4aacfe1b7d260b46d1665b03", "ja": "あたしのこと、アイドルなのに、\nギターも続けててえらいって。", "zh": "明明是偶像，却还一直坚持弹吉他，真了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "57b5b1c73c3d067ea5e0d1e1d19c2dcf68e46500bbf759fb315b642128f8098b", "ja": "全然、そんなことないよ。あたしだって……。", "zh": "完全没有那回事。我也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
