{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1081_p", "source_sha256": "72e786e33683fe43300b9a6b88613c416927b227647b3222f5c3779db3a5a878", "ja": "次の公演……って、奈緒達の定期公演か？\nけど、ツアー中だぞ。", "zh": "下一场公演……是奈绪她们的定期公演吗？\n可是现在还在巡演中啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1082_050jul", "source_sha256": "d64ba723cf5b1ce23ffb942a89ed071abf52c26edbefdd7dea480705e6fa4123", "ja": "その日は、中央エリアの地方公演は入ってない。\n都内に戻ってるから、劇場には出られる！", "zh": "那天没有安排中央地区的地方公演。\n因为已经回到东京都内了，所以能参加剧场公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1083_050jul", "source_sha256": "6188ef4cd27d37a83a66337ae4d9ec53990f7a2df634ec68b5b78104f3c79aa0", "ja": "全体曲ならツアー先でもやってるし、合わせられる。\n他にも必要なことがあるなら、レッスンを増やす！", "zh": "如果是全体曲的话，在巡演地点也排练过，能配合得上。\n如果还有其他需要做的事，那就增加训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1084_050jul", "source_sha256": "f4eb4c7381519c6d7f0445119461fbdf6325cc68ea7aa99ec29053fe78b3ca9a", "ja": "それで……できればこの曲は、\nあたしひとりに歌わせて欲しい。", "zh": "所以……如果可以的话，\n希望能让我一个人唱这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1085_p", "source_sha256": "98b7e3ed3432d5db0d632484b60babd3f79a0e6ed9f704205a78209306e4ca4d", "ja": "ジュリア……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1086_050jul", "source_sha256": "b44244cc68daac74aff4ecc3ed532f358a5a4dd11cfba8838e898caa80602cea", "ja": "だって、そうだろ。あたしのワガママに、\nみんなを付き合わせるわけにはいかないし……。", "zh": "毕竟是这样吧。我不能让大家陪着我的任性胡闹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1087_050jul", "source_sha256": "306ad1ab921de3edc1ec8a2954850b27b2cd037c1c503fd94788c0a4d728547b", "ja": "それに、何より……あたしがひとりで歌いたいんだ。", "zh": "而且最重要的是……我想一个人唱歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1088_p", "source_sha256": "b1dfc53cedbe6a0a736812afff8bb2303a6d1ccd27d19676b7658fc2879b81fe", "ja": "わかった。それならOKだよ。", "zh": "明白了。既然这样那就没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1089_050jul", "source_sha256": "e71bbee6960e302d95a6f37b80e11f0f71337cb8754022fac68834188b4c7f8e", "ja": "え！？", "zh": "诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1090_p", "source_sha256": "662a452fb635121704d4ea054734b3aa0f058a01ea6efcd0b6084d674bbb6ea8", "ja": "「みんなに迷惑を掛けるから」なんて理由だったら、\nきっちり止めるつもりだったけど。", "zh": "要是理由是“会给大家添麻烦”，\n那我本来是打算好好阻止你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1091_p", "source_sha256": "73ce14b3d43a8c376431ce5bd08eeee787528daa6d4f78f22855b9824b5a11a4", "ja": "「ジュリアがひとりで歌いたい」なら、それでいい。\n任せるよ。", "zh": "既然是“茱莉亚想一个人唱”，那就没问题。\n交给你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1092_050jul", "source_sha256": "1077a21ed68baf8966cc47dce5716e298afefb2a2058f2539478099e021b5b1c", "ja": "{$P$}……\nサンキュー！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n谢啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1093_050jul", "source_sha256": "f10a1b443959bdcda80de8067243005885ffa167e633267bdc0d0f46c6cc21bc", "ja": "それと……チケット、用意してもらってもいいか？\nあいつらを呼びたいんだ。", "zh": "还有……能帮我准备几张票吗？\n我想邀请那帮家伙来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1094_p", "source_sha256": "12409163cb58d4887f28f0a9de48ee05c6dff29b49f933b1653ee3c4e4945b0e", "ja": "もちろん。\nセンターが、よく見える席を用意しておくよ。", "zh": "当然没问题。\n我会给你准备能清楚看到C位的座位的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1095_p", "source_sha256": "ba763bfc5da6af75752927f38930490cac0f1719770db0858093babc88e9df7c", "ja": "思いっきり、ぶちかましてやれ！", "zh": "尽情发挥，把现场搞得热火朝天吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1096_050jul", "source_sha256": "36715a0db82dfed3cebfb77240a999689b9a75e47453710dab9c549718e0684c", "ja": "ああ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1097_null", "source_sha256": "c5da42bb37a10be9674da0026032e7e12a25d93ab65d089a270b694cf8d92b30", "ja": "劇場定期公演　当日……", "zh": "剧场定期公演　当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1098_yuma", "source_sha256": "2ae4b97dd5da79614b4d76f506e2a58b4b7c68a69e513fa360e3d6e81a58cb8f", "ja": "ジュリアさん、急に僕らをライブに呼んだりして、\nどげんしたとやろ？　今、ツアー中じゃないと？", "zh": "茱莉亚先生，突然把我们叫来参加演唱会，\n这是怎么了？我们现在不是正在巡演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1099_sara", "source_sha256": "d8b4203675fce2335bf31d354c05173b811cf8b9081d64ffde657941cdbb3683", "ja": "ツアーね……。\n忙しいってトコ、見せつけたいんじゃないの？", "zh": "巡演啊……是想炫耀自己有多忙吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1100_yuma", "source_sha256": "eec2452e710e6c78cfe09a4a696fd001ccafb2a619591079b8c42101b75de050", "ja": "ジュリアさんはそげな人じゃなか！", "zh": "茱莉亚先生不是那样的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1101_sara", "source_sha256": "581709f37d4602df440e33ea5ca2054f2dcfe396495c6114dfd655a8dd8ef294", "ja": "ふーん、どうだか！", "zh": "哼，谁知道呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1102_hiro", "source_sha256": "51af321c0f3e3ae5a42f1b62f8dbe5527a7cc7b701d1193bd436fcf2c462aed5", "ja": "しっ。\nお前ら、もう始まるから……！", "zh": "嘘。\n你们，马上就要开始了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1103_039kon", "source_sha256": "3272cde5311f923d82c9737e24e9736edad3c4b7a080fa94d293426906cfadd9", "ja": "『Thank You!』、聞いてもらいました！\n……今日はこの後、特別な曲があるの。", "zh": "大家听了《Thank You!》！\n……今天在这之后，还有一首特别的歌哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1104_033sih", "source_sha256": "7b49855b3952bb8b73cd726e61d78329da9a63b16e86bf95173d63fc72ca737e", "ja": "それでは……\nよろしくお願いします、ジュリアさん。", "zh": "那么……接下来就拜托您了，茱莉亚先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1105_050jul", "source_sha256": "a1d844cf91b718890e81e778d8579416cddac7e9912b8c9472a6ee0ab1f173ed", "ja": "サンキュー。", "zh": "谢啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1106_audience", "source_sha256": "5bc69e5b1c1ad7ceead171d240a9d31173ed372760ba22fbc0b5aa7947d8d15c", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ……", "zh": "啪啪啪啪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1107_p", "source_sha256": "3c2d06a1eb0c0a0cde35dd0d25659ea64a64fc6893de7f015f71707dade42308", "ja": "（ツアー中に、劇場での新曲披露。\nステージに立つのはジュリアひとり……）", "zh": "（巡演期间，在剧场首次披露新曲。站在舞台上的只有茱莉亚一个人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1108_050jul", "source_sha256": "a0867797524db7702e127435a6febec4c932f834b0d9dd53b3853f0471092035", "ja": "……みんな、今日は来てくれて本当にありがとう。\nみんなも知ってるとおり、あたしは今、ツアー中だ。", "zh": "……各位，今天真的很感谢大家能来。\n正如大家所知道的，我现在正在进行巡演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1109_050jul", "source_sha256": "f7784e12c8fc2af2ba04b8063f30123bb63842c3829490df9072f069ee012e97", "ja": "なのに今日、劇場のステージに立たせてもらったのは、\nあたしの個人的な思いからだ。", "zh": "可是今天能站在剧场的舞台上，是因为我的一份私心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1110_050jul", "source_sha256": "322369936b0b35f33bf9c31d124e0fdf66fae6b5d6546dd5a760e8976af4081f", "ja": "だから今日は、すこしだけ……\nあたしのことを話させてほしい。", "zh": "所以今天，就让我稍微……说说我的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1112_050jul", "source_sha256": "48919cc1ffc0dcf5969fa2b770973a944732e1fa6fcfd8a552cc891b38e6d792", "ja": "あたしがアイドルになる前、バンドをやってたことは、\nあちこちで話してるから。知ってる人もいると思う。", "zh": "在成为偶像之前，我组过乐队的事，\n我已经在各处提到过了。应该也有人知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1113_050jul", "source_sha256": "4f0121339ea7e70b59f0d3bc8ce3740be511d3c0813f9f196ae0a88423fbee44", "ja": "メンバーと上手くいかなくなって、あたしはバンドを\nやめた。その後、プロデューサーにスカウトされてさ。", "zh": "因为和乐队成员相处得不太顺利，我就退出了乐队。\n后来被制作人发掘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1114_050jul", "source_sha256": "f53e7dd920d34f390ae58dbdcf7f4f46fb607d2a0e867840e15aba0c09f3fd1a", "ja": "ロックのつもりだったから、アイドルって聞いて\n驚いたけど……でも、チャンスには違いないだろ？", "zh": "本来是打算走摇滚路线的，所以听说要当偶像时吓了一跳……不过，这无论如何都是个机会吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1116_050jul", "source_sha256": "043ab340802b6ec0aec8d4fa82ced19c3440face97d887a6fb76487cc560795f", "ja": "あたしは、バンドでデビューできなかった。\n……そういう意味じゃ、負け犬なんだ。", "zh": "我没能以乐队成员的身份出道。\n……从这个意义上说，我就是一条丧家犬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_107_1117_sara", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
